{"4416160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JIN", "steam_appid": 4416160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JIN</strong> is a traditional-inspired strategy board game built around clean rules, deep tactics, and satisfying mind games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your pieces across the board, combine them to increase their value, and capture your opponent by landing with equal or lower strength. Every turn is a puzzle, and one mistake can flip the entire match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and a calm aesthetic, JIN is easy to learn in minutes, but rewards players who think ahead, set traps, and master positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical board strategy with fast, turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move orthogonally or diagonally and plan every step</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your own pieces by stacking to create stronger values</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture enemy stacks using smart positioning and value control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique neutral zone rules that create interesting mid-board tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to win by capturing key pieces or reaching the score limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal, relaxing presentation with deep competitive strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JIN is designed for players who love pure strategy, clean design, and games where skill matters more than luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JIN</strong> is a traditional-inspired strategy board game built around clean rules, deep tactics, and satisfying mind games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your pieces across the board, combine them to increase their value, and capture your opponent by landing with equal or lower strength. Every turn is a puzzle, and one mistake can flip the entire match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and a calm aesthetic, JIN is easy to learn in minutes, but rewards players who think ahead, set traps, and master positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical board strategy with fast, turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move orthogonally or diagonally and plan every step</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your own pieces by stacking to create stronger values</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture enemy stacks using smart positioning and value control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique neutral zone rules that create interesting mid-board tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to win by capturing key pieces or reaching the score limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal, relaxing presentation with deep competitive strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JIN is designed for players who love pure strategy, clean design, and games where skill matters more than luck.</p>", "short_description": "JIN is a modern traditional strategy board game where every move matters. Combine pieces to grow stronger, outplay your opponent, and capture your way to victory.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416160/1d66587de841c8e32745771251c9889d28572429/header.jpg?t=1772449392", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416160/044fced82fef87c5aa415dd642c691be173bb64d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772449392", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416160/044fced82fef87c5aa415dd642c691be173bb64d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772449392", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Mini